{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_89_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_89","textTraditional":"一、二十有六年，春，王正月，己未，公會莒子、衞寧速，盟於向。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_89_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_89","textTraditional":"公不會大夫，其曰寧速何也？以其隨莒子，可以言會也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_89_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_89","textTraditional":"二、齊人侵我西鄙，公追齊師，至巂，弗及。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_89_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_89","textTraditional":"人，微者也。侵，淺事也。公之追之，非正也。至巂，急辭也。弗及者，弗與也，可以及而不敢及也。其侵也曰人，其追也曰師，以公之弗及，大之也。弗及，內辭也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_89_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_89","textTraditional":"三、夏，齊人伐我北鄙。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_89_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_89","textTraditional":"四、衞人伐齊。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_89_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_89","textTraditional":"五、公子遂如楚乞師。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_89_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_89","textTraditional":"乞，重辭也，重人之死也，非所乞也。師出不必反，戰不必勝，故重之也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_89_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_89","textTraditional":"六、秋，楚人滅夔，以夔子歸。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_89_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_89","textTraditional":"夔，國也。不日，微國也。以歸，猶愈乎執也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_89_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_89","textTraditional":"七、冬，楚人伐宋，圍閔。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_89_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_89","textTraditional":"伐國不言圍邑，此其言圍何也？以吾用其師，目其事也。非道用師也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_89_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_89","textTraditional":"八、公以楚師伐齊，取穀。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_89_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_89","textTraditional":"以者，不以者也。民者，君之本也。使民以其死，非其正也。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_89_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_89","textTraditional":"九、公至自伐齊。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_89_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_89","textTraditional":"惡事不致，此其致之何也？危之也。","sentenceOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}